  "body": "A docs-only push keeps its own post-merge run and skips the batch gate when the changed paths are documentation or process files that are outside the excluded test-input classes. Dispatches always run. This implements option 2 of #4054.\n\nThe review fix keeps the batch gate running for `README.md`, `GEMINI.md`, `.agents/`, the `camcraft-mcp` skill, agent documentation, tester kits, site content and tests, and examples. These paths include documents compiled into tests, MCP drift inputs, recorded posted programs, guide assertions, and catalog inputs. Existing code/build-input exclusions remain in place.\n\nValidation on head `5872000a18cd9eac3566d82704b0f42b46370ff5`, against current `upstream/main` `83d52ef6a283497e00a1a13c8403ee4671cd7795`:\n\n- `bash .github/scripts/test-post-merge-skip.sh`: 29 cases passed. The 17 new independent cases cover every input class identified in the review: root README and GEMINI, both MCP skills, agent MCP docs, tester-kit program/project/README, MCP/AI/troubleshooting/getting-started/machine/operations/multi-axis guides, site navigation tests, and catalog READMEs.\n- Mutation proof: running the updated tests with `SCRIPT` set to the production script from reviewed head `8075f1c8ab3eaaef3d5a1eee9648b9cd96664e16` failed all 17 new cases (exit 1). Restoring the fixed script passed all 29 (exit 0), repeated on the final head.\n- `bash -n .github/scripts/post-merge-skip.sh .github/scripts/test-post-merge-skip.sh`: passed.\n- `cargo xtask gate quick --base upstream/main`: passed; 0 steps, 0 failed, 0 stalled. The diff is confined to `.github/`.\n- `cargo xtask gate batch --only 'app suites: example_catalog'`: passed; 1 step, 0 failed, 0 stalled. Catalog suite: 43 passed, 4 ignored.\n- Clippy: not applicable; no Rust crate is touched.\n- Heavy lanes: not applicable; no motion, simulation, post, geometry, or app operation changes.\n\nGoldens moved: none; the example catalog suite was run and passed. No recorded program, catalog file, or UI file changed. No additional golden suite is reached by this CI-only diff.\n\nNot exercised: a live GitHub Actions run on main. No UI screenshots apply. The workflow change still requires maintainer inspection before merge.\n\nChangelog: none\n\nFixes #4054\n",
